# Furry & Fursona Art and Character Design Pipeline

The **Furry & Fursona Art and Character Design** skill governs the creation, prompt engineering, reference sheet (refsheet) layout formulation, and 3D avatar technical specifications for anthropomorphic characters.

It solves common generative AI failure modes—such as anatomical confusion (human feet vs. digitigrade paws), multi-view pose blending, color bleeding across fur markings, and hallucinated palette text.

---

## 🎯 When to Activate

* **Fursona Concept & Refsheet Creation:** Designing new anthro characters, multi-angle turnaround sheets (front, back, profile), and expression sheets.
* **AI Prompt Formulation Across Model Families:**
  - **SDXL / Pony Diffusion / NovelAI:** Generating Danbooru/e621 tag taxonomies and negative prompt isolation.
  - **Midjourney v6 & Niji 6:** Crafting cinematic or kemono turnaround prompts with `--ar 16:9`.
  - **Flux.1 & DALL-E 3:** Engineering spatial natural language prompts that separate front and rear poses without body fusion.
* **Color Palette Swatch Generation:** Rendering crisp, clean PNG/SVG color chips with exact hex codes via Python rather than relying on messy AI-generated text.
* **3D & VRChat Avatar Design Preparation:** Exporting technical rigging specifications (PhysBones ear/tail chains, ARKit visemes, digitigrade inverse kinematics, and ORM texture channels).

