## 🛠️ CLI Generator (`fursona_generator.py`)

Located at `scripts/fursona_generator.py`, this tool automates profile formulation, prompt translation, and palette rendering.

### 1. Build a Character Profile
```bash
python3 config/skills/furry-fursona-art-design/scripts/fursona_generator.py build \
  --name "Kaelen" \
  --species "wolf" \
  --leg-type "digitigrade" \
  --primary "#2B2D42" \
  --secondary "#EDF2F4" \
  --accent "#EF233C" \
  --paw-pads "#D90429" \
  --eyes "#8D99AE" \
  --output .agents/fursonas/kaelen_profile.json
```

### 2. Generate Model-Specific AI Prompts
```bash
python3 config/skills/furry-fursona-art-design/scripts/fursona_generator.py prompt \
  --profile .agents/fursonas/kaelen_profile.json
```
Outputs tailored prompts for:
* **SDXL / Pony Diffusion (Pony XL):** High-confidence tag strings with negative anatomy filters (`photorealistic, human feet, flat feet, plantigrade feet, deformed paws`).
* **Midjourney v6 / Niji 6:** Turnaround phrasing with aspect ratio flags (`--ar 16:9 --v 6.1`).
* **Flux.1 / DALL-E 3:** Bounded spatial layout descriptions ("left side front view, right side rear view on light gray studio canvas").

### 3. Render Crisp Local Color Palette Swatches
Renders an uncorrupted graphic swatch strip using Pillow, displaying exact hex codes and labels:
```bash
python3 config/skills/furry-fursona-art-design/scripts/fursona_generator.py swatch \
  --profile .agents/fursonas/kaelen_profile.json \
  --output .agents/fursonas/kaelen_palette.png
```

### 4. Export 3D & VRChat Technical Specification
Generates rigging requirements, PhysBones bone chains, ARKit visemes, and PBR ORM texture channel configurations:
```bash
python3 config/skills/furry-fursona-art-design/scripts/fursona_generator.py spec-3d \
  --profile .agents/fursonas/kaelen_profile.json \
  --output .agents/fursonas/kaelen_3d_spec.json
```

